sequenceDiagram
  participant PLM as Product definition / AP242
  participant MES as MES genealogy
  participant Edge as OPC UA / MTConnect / Sparkplug
  participant Met as QIF / metrology
  participant Core as Canonical engineering model
  participant Quality as Quality engine
  participant OCAP as Operational control

  PLM->>Core: product + revision + characteristic identity
  MES->>Core: unit + run + recipe + equipment
  Edge->>Core: timestamped signal + quality/session state
  Met->>Core: CTQ measurement + device + uncertainty
  Core->>Core: validate identity / pairing / provenance
  alt evidence incomplete or inconsistent
    Core-->>Quality: fail closed / not assessable
  else evidence eligible
    Core->>Quality: normalized same-unit evidence
    Quality->>Quality: prediction / MSA / stability / capability
    Quality->>OCAP: activate control when gates pass
    OCAP->>OCAP: detect special cause
    OCAP->>OCAP: contain → correct → requalify
  end
